  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "做伙來唸詩 - 攑香tuè拜"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "\n<div class=\"tg-article\" style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft JhengHei', sans-serif; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.8; color: #333;\">\n    <h1 style=\"color: #000; font-size: 36px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 5px; font-weight: bold;\">攑香tuè拜</h1>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n        <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 20px; margin: 0;\">/ 洪月珠</p>\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-images\">\n        <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiHL0Yhq3LjtUW81OUZ01M4K5SjHpO_8HH1MGxC1EtdRzL4o2ie_jZnvbcl3mPP4tsZLzcUub9XNTmZ0rndEncLA2wPIgUYGwdqWTEtIA4I3mNBlubqDnHD_MzBHuz9Zqp74F1j3URtj5iEjXLObp__pP_fcADtmoig0Cn5hOFddfJHHP2XBOn3TinMw-P9\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 4px;\"></div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-content\" style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-bottom: 30px; text-align: justify; padding: 0 10px;\">\n        阿爸誠心攑香拜<br>到底是leh拜啥mi̍h？<br>拜天敬神求媽祖<br>拜地敬魔求公祖<br>拜啥mi̍h？求啥mi̍h？<br>求媽祖保平安<br>祭公祖囤家伙<br><br>阿母祈求攑香拜<br>到底是leh講啥mi̍h？<br>講天講地講序細<br>講東講西講翁婿<br>講啥mi̍h？Sueh啥mi̍h？<br>Sueh序細平安大<br>講翁婿事業在<br><br>媽祖婆顯聖來保庇<br>阿媽追隨聖母ê形影<br>勇行百里tuè進香<br>我問阿媽是leh huah啥mi̍h？<br>「進--啊！進--啊！」<br>Hannh！啥？<br>Kám是心內思念ê hit个人？\n    </div>\n\n    \n\n    <div class=\"donation-section\" style=\"background-color: #fcfcfc; border: 1px solid #eeeeee; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 40px;\">\n        <div style=\"width: 100%;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiTTu-D2GM9ys1ukLuH8l57x4Jre3U2KWvSfqI_LeCLvvkZn1AOJRe2vXW7HQG3F9iOlHmaBmfk6ABhcgWLxtjYOZ5Sk-5WZivj1Oz-CJCHft3RCzDp6JMsHNkaEUca2LAMUob9tZQjHIEpJzESKcC-eXb6Ru4yqgQGrkzAC0r5LikyR-1zgp7O8T6zpcd7\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"padding: 30px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 22px;\">\n                <b><span style=\"color: #3778cd;\">#台文通訊BONG報</span> 386期，2026年05月出刊。</b>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會</div>\n            <div style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 16px;\">\n                線上捐款(定期定額) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a><br>\n                線上捐款(單筆) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 15px; line-height: 1.5;\">\n                郵政劃撥：19021486 / 戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會<br>\n                電匯：123-20-050514-2 (華南銀行士林分行)\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #050505; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 15px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; text-align: justify;\">\n                #李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
  },
